 **Parameters:**
-*   $c_{refl}$: Reflection coefficient multiplier. Controls the attenuation of color per bounce. Default value: $0.3$ [S2, unofficial].
-*   $N_{max}$: Number of reflection bounces. If $1$, uses a single bounce path. Default value: $0$ (no recursion) [S2, unofficial] or $1$ [S4, unofficial].
-*   $\epsilon$: Transmittance threshold. Stops recursion when mask magnitude drops below this value. Default value: $0.001$ [S4, unofficial].
-*   $\delta$: Offset distance for ray origin. Prevents self-intersection. Value: $0.05$ [S2, unofficial] or $0.001$ [S4, unofficial].
+*   $c_{\text{refl}}$: Reflection coefficient multiplier. Controls the attenuation of color per bounce. Default value: $0.3$ [S5, unofficial].
